<title>MAURITIUS: Mauritius rupee firmer on dollar, weaker on pound.</title>
<headline>Mauritius rupee firmer on dollar, weaker on pound.</headline>
<dateline>PORT LOUIS 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Mauritian rupee firmed against the dollar while weakening versus the pound on Friday, forex dealers said.</p>
<p>The rupee was fixed at a mean commercial rate of 19.866 for one dollar from 19.871 on Thursday. Against the pound, the rupee was quoted at a mean of 33.7220 from 33.6525 on Thursday.</p>
